title: Day01MorningPart04_02
---
<<if !$Marvin_hasSpokenTo>>
    Unknown: Hey, do you happen to know where is the art class?
    Me: Oh, I'm actually heading to the same class.
    Unknown: Ah I see, so I guess we both are classmates then.
    Marvin: The name's Marvin though, what's yours?
    *He reaches out a hand for a handshake*
    -> *Reach out your hand as well*
        <<set $Marvin_reachingOutHand = true>>
        <<set $Marvin_quirkPoint += 1>>
        <<set $Marvin_likePoint += 1>>
    -> *Just introduce yourself*
    Me: I'm Jerome. Nice to meet you.
    <<if $Marvin_reachingOutHand>>
        Marvin: Haha, Looks like we're going get along very well. 
        *Both shake hands for a bit pulling back*
    <<endif>>
    Marvin: Nice to meet you Jerome!
    Marvin: Still though, you didn't actually answer my question.
    Me: Oh right!
    -> I actually have no idea as well. We should find them together.
        <<if $Marvin_reachingOutHand>>
            Marvin: I'll be right behind you then.
        <<else>>
            Marvin: Ok, I'll tag along.
        <<endif>>
    -> I do know where it is though. I'll take you there.
        <<if $Marvin_reachingOutHand>>
            Marvin: Then lead the way!
        <<else>>
            Marvin: Ok, Thank you!
        <<endif>>
    <<set $Marvin_hasSpokenTo = true>>
    <<if $Marvin_hasSpokenTo && $Shelly_hasSpokenTo>>
        <<set_object_active "Scene_Loader">>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    <<if $Marvin_reachingOutHand>>
        Marvin: Don't worry about me, I'll be following everywhere you go.
    <<else>>
        Marvin: Take your time, I don't mind!
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===
